{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">我是朱邵林</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">今年44岁</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">我在京东快递临夏积石山营业部送快递</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">我们站点日常有3个人</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">其他两名叫杨文柱、李建成</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">12月19日地震发生时</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">我和家里人正住在县城的楼房里</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">地震很强烈，震碎了一个暖水瓶</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">兄弟们互报平安</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">相约第二天正常在快递站见</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">自此，我们配送从未中断</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">截止2023年12月31日</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">我已经送出了3628单</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704250863336.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">2023年12月31日早8点</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">今年的最后一天</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">和一年来的300多个早晨没有什么不同</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">同事们卸货、装车，准备出站</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704250875001.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">10点，我满载一车快递</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">行驶在吹麻滩镇花园路</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">县城面积不大</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">每一条街道我都很熟悉</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">也和许多客户成了朋友</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">51岁的王姐在这里开了一个面店</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">她说她买了一件羽绒服</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">再有几周，在广州读书的二儿子就回来了</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;家里冷，买一件厚羽绒服备着&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">看着大家的生活逐渐回归正常轨道</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">看着收到包裹的人期待的表情</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">我觉得自己的工作还是很有意义</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704250898045.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">12月19日甘肃积石山6.2级地震发生以来</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">我们的订单变多了</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">工作量比平时大幅增加</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">省公司在周边抽调近10名同事来支援我们</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">同事的家属也自愿过来帮忙</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">大家一起全力守护灾区群众网购和寄递需求</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">这十几天里，我们派送的包裹</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">有人们第一时间捐助的感冒药</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">有从新疆捐助的棉大衣</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">有从武汉捐助过来的电热毯和被子&hellip;&hellip;</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">天南海北对积石山受灾群众的关心和温暖</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">通过京东物流汇聚</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">再通过我们的手，送到需要它们的人手中</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704250921376.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">现在甘肃积石山地震灾区</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">全面转入灾后恢复重建阶段</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">快递连接着积石山的生产与生活</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">我觉得我们也在为积石山的重建尽一份力</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">下午16点，配送仍在继续</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">我身后的每一件包裹，都是一个盼头</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">一个个小包裹，装着大家丰富的日常生活</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">新的一年，我希望大家都平平安安</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">我也会继续在自己的岗位中</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">把每一份寄托和爱传递下去</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704250942294.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704250957217.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01784", "contentTitle": "2023年最后一天，我在甘肃积石山送快递", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1704250030000, "id": 4041, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704250980592.jpg", "updateTime": 1708235992000}}